{
 "_note": "還沒歸到任務的 NPC 台詞。有歸屬的請放 quest/ 底下對應的任務檔——那裡才有 speaker 與 stage，譯者看得到前後文。",
 "Let's hope no more grooks waltz in here.": "希望別再有 grook 闖進來了。",
 "Identify your helmet at the  Item Identifier and then return to me with it equipped. After you've done that I'll let you pass.": "到 Item Identifier 把頭盔鑑定好，戴上之後再回來找我。做完我就放你們過去。",
 "Off you go, I've said everything I have to say.": "去吧，我要說的都說完了。",
 "So, this is the gate marking the border between Wynn and Fruma?": "所以，這就是劃分 Wynn 與 Fruma 的那道大門？",
 "+{~} minutes speed boost.": "+{~} 分鐘的速度提升。",
 "Talk to the Guard at [-{~}, {~}, -{~}]": "到 [-{~1}, {~2}, -{~3}] 找衛兵說話",
