 "Unlock your first Ability by using your Compass and opening the Ability Tree on the left.": "用你的羅盤打開左邊的技能樹，解鎖你的第一個技能。",
 "That guard wasn't kidding. This place is crawling with the corrupt.": "那個衛兵不是開玩笑的。這地方到處都是腐敗生物。",
 "Still think those corrupted don't stand a chance against you?": "還覺得那些腐敗生物打不過你嗎？",
 "So this is the Wynn we've all been hearing about... It's beautiful.": "所以這就是我們一直聽說的 Wynn……真美。",
 "Oh well, this area should be clear by now. {p} is just up ahead after all.": "算了，這一帶現在應該清乾淨了。畢竟 {p} 就在前面而已。",
 "Looks like it, yep! Are you two ready for the start of our new lives?": "看樣子是的，沒錯！你們兩個準備好開始新生活了嗎？",
